4332
04:02:10,280 --> 04:02:11,820
We're gonna have mixers.

4333
04:02:12,640 --> 04:02:14,040
We're gonna have the whole shebang.

4334
04:02:15,700 --> 04:02:16,140
Yeah.

4335
04:02:16,800 --> 04:02:17,800
The ultimate heist.

4336
04:02:17,900 --> 04:02:18,240
I like it.

4337
04:02:20,660 --> 04:02:21,900
Isaac Newton over here.

4338
