4367
04:03:52,700 --> 04:03:53,700
More room for Jackie.

4368
04:03:53,840 --> 04:03:54,200
Exactly.

4369
04:03:54,560 --> 04:03:56,180
It's gonna be way more room for Jackie.

4370
04:03:58,560 --> 04:04:00,500
She's gonna be able to jump all around.

4371
