4380
04:04:30,530 --> 04:04:31,710
Obviously I'm gonna install those.

4381
04:04:31,950 --> 04:04:33,610
In fact, I may even expand on it.

4382
04:04:41,930 --> 04:04:43,710
I don't need a sorting system in my apartment.

4383
04:04:43,790 --> 04:04:45,670
