4384
04:04:46,550 --> 04:04:47,430
It's just Minecraft.

4385
04:04:47,430 --> 04:04:48,510
It's my weak spot, you know?

4386
04:04:50,970 --> 04:04:53,630
You could make a breathing apparatus out of kelp too.

4387
04:04:54,690 --> 04:04:55,390
I could!

4388
04:04:58,260 --> 04:05:01,060
We're gonna establish a beachhead and hunt them down aggressively.

4389
