Is it me or is chat really delayed?

4420
04:06:41,550 --> 04:06:42,270
Wait, what the?

4421
04:06:44,650 --> 04:06:46,810
Is that just me or is chat kind of delayed?

4422
04:06:49,450 --> 04:06:50,090
Oh, okay.

4423
04:06:50,290 --> 04:06:51,050
Maybe it is just me then.

4424
04:06:52,970 --> 04:06:53,870
Maybe it's because...

4425
04:06:53,870 --> 04:06:56,550
So, I'm also streaming in 2K resolution right now.

4426
04:06:57,430 --> 04:06:58,590
Or 1440p technically.

4427
04:06:59,830 --> 04:07:01,170
Maybe that has something to do with it.

4428
04:07:01,390 --> 04:07:04,030
By the way, how has that been for you guys?

4429
04:07:06,250 --> 04:07:07,870
How does 1440p work?

4430
04:07:08,410 --> 04:07:09,530
Does any of you use it?

4431
04:07:12,540 --> 04:07:13,840
Is it a big difference?

4432
04:07:14,120 --> 04:07:14,940
Does it work well?

4433
04:07:15,020 --> 04:07:15,780
There's no problems?

4434
04:07:17,880 --> 04:07:18,680
Nothing like that?

4435
04:07:22,240 --> 04:07:23,180
Won't let me use it?

4436
04:07:23,260 --> 04:07:25,120
Is that because you're in a country where you can't use it?

4437
04:07:25,180 --> 04:07:28,820
Because I know some countries cannot at this point.

4438
04:07:30,620 --> 04:07:33,340
Apparently, they're rolling it out to more countries as time goes on.

4439
04:07:37,440 --> 04:07:39,560
You didn't even notice it was on 1440p?

4440
04:07:39,560 --> 04:07:45,220
I used to be in 1080p and when I would look at the VODs on Twitch just to check, it looked like ass.

4441
04:07:46,240 --> 04:07:48,400
And I was like, damn, is that what it looks like when I'm live?

4442
04:07:48,640 --> 04:07:50,180
Holy shit, that's bad.

4443
04:07:51,500 --> 04:07:52,760
Well, I just had to do this.

4444
04:07:57,170 --> 04:07:58,430
You're on 720p?

4445
04:07:58,890 --> 04:08:02,070
Isn't that like really blocky though and pixelated?

4446
04:08:05,430 --> 04:08:06,510
Twitch VOD compression?

4447
04:08:06,510 --> 04:08:08,690
Oh, is the VOD worse than the livestream then?

4448
04:08:09,450 --> 04:08:11,790
Because if that's the case, then that's good.

4449
04:08:12,130 --> 04:08:15,290
I mean, it's not good, but, you know, at least the livestream is not suffering.

4450
04:08:18,540 --> 04:08:26,200
I know it's Minecraft, but even Minecraft, you know, it does look a lot worse in low bitrate.

4451
04:08:33,590 --> 04:08:35,130
Yeah, it is a lot better than 1080.

4452
04:08:35,370 --> 04:08:37,070
Like, it is a lot more pixels you get.

4453
04:08:37,350 --> 04:08:41,170
And Twitch also allows you to up the bitrate to quite a bit.

4454
04:08:41,650 --> 04:08:46,310
Right now, it is on what is the bitrate like right now?

4455
04:08:46,830 --> 04:08:47,570
9,000.

4456
04:08:48,190 --> 04:08:52,410
9,200 and usually you can only have 6,000 on 1080.

4457
04:08:53,530 --> 04:09:01,010
I think it's dynamically adjusting the bitrate too, so if I were to play something very motion heavy right now, I think the bitrate would go even higher.

4458
04:09:04,950 --> 04:09:06,010
Yes, exactly.

4459
04:09:06,250 --> 04:09:06,590
Multi.

4460
04:09:12,490 --> 04:09:15,410
Yeah, it dips during rain and I guess snow too.

4461
04:09:15,590 --> 04:09:16,750
Snow is like the big offender.

4462
04:09:17,630 --> 04:09:19,930
Because it's like big particles and there's a lot of them.

4463
04:09:23,340 --> 04:09:25,320
But Minecraft snow is also insane.

4464
04:09:25,780 --> 04:09:27,500
Like, the whole screen is just like confetti.

4465
04:09:28,460 --> 04:09:29,700
It's completely over the top.

4466
04:09:36,130 --> 04:09:37,290
Alright, guys, I'm out of here!

4467
04:09:37,790 --> 04:09:39,030
Thank you so much for being here.

4468
04:09:39,390 --> 04:09:40,170
Checking it out with me.

4469
04:09:40,690 --> 04:09:42,070
I think we made a lot of good progress.

4470
04:09:42,150 --> 04:09:44,130
Next stream is going to be Pog, as the kids say.

4471
04:09:44,870 --> 04:09:45,750
Can't wait for that one.

4472
04:09:45,910 --> 04:09:46,810
We're going to belt it up.

4473
04:09:48,010 --> 04:09:48,850
It's going to be a good time.

4474
04:09:50,070 --> 04:09:51,150
Anyway, I'll see you around.

4475
04:09:52,450 --> 04:09:54,910
Have a great Friday and enjoy your weekend, okay?

4476
04:09:55,390 --> 04:09:55,970
That's an order.
